# Spec Kit required (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

See repo `SPECKIT.md` and `.specify/memory/constitution.md`.

## When Spec Kit is mandatory

Always write/update a feature spec before coding for:

- New features / user-visible behavior
- Architecture or contract changes
- Hotfixes / regressions (still Spec; shorter path allowed)

Forbidden: jump from chat to code with no `spec.md` / feature directory.

## Default flow

`/speckit-specify` → `/speckit-plan` → `/speckit-tasks` → `/speckit-implement` → `/speckit-converge`

## Hotfix (still Spec, shortened)

`/speckit-specify` (mark hotfix: symptom / root cause / acceptance) → `/speckit-tasks` → `/speckit-implement` → `/speckit-converge`

- Implement only from `tasks.md` when it exists
- Update `project-context.md` when architecture changes
- Run the verification named in the feature docs before merge
